    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/Spikeball-Logo-linear-yellow_aae5a939-430b-4f4a-8947-9d456e5277ad.PNG?t=1745855734\" /></div>Spikeball is a sports video game that adapts the classic game of Spikeball to the digital environment. Designed to offer a fast and competitive gaming experience, it allows you to face players from all over the world or enjoy games with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Spikeball, accuracy, strategy and speed are key. The the game is designed to deliver exciting games in every session. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast and Accurate Gameplay: Dynamic games that capture the essence of Spikeball.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer Modes:\u00a0Compete online with a friend or join a match online.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Customization: Configure your avatar with different clothing and accessory options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Background Music: The main menu has a DJ that adds a sound environment according to the rhythm of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/c484062eb863fe8b4eea1eee9e66f71c.avif?t=1745855734\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/Spikeball-Logo-linear-yellow_aae5a939-430b-4f4a-8947-9d456e5277ad.PNG?t=1745855734\" /></div>Spikeball is a sports video game that adapts the classic game of Spikeball to the digital environment. Designed to offer a fast and competitive gaming experience, it allows you to face players from all over the world or enjoy games with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Spikeball, accuracy, strategy and speed are key. The the game is designed to deliver exciting games in every session. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast and Accurate Gameplay: Dynamic games that capture the essence of Spikeball.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer Modes:\u00a0Compete online with a friend or join a match online.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player Customization: Configure your avatar with different clothing and accessory options.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Background Music: The main menu has a DJ that adds a sound environment according to the rhythm of the game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906740/extras/c484062eb863fe8b4eea1eee9e66f71c.avif?t=1745855734\" /></div></p>",
